Breaks: kidux-greeter (<< 0.2.0),
Description: Python library shared by every Kidux component
 Kidux is a Debian derivative for a child's first computer. Its sign-in screen,
 lock screen, launcher, adult panel and privileged daemon are separate programs
 that have to agree completely about where a child's settings live, how they are
 written, what the interface calls things in each language, and how to reach the
 daemon.
 .
 This package holds that agreement in one place, so there is only ever one
 answer. It is not useful on its own.
